## Approach

Replace the flat `parent_qualified_name: Option<String>` field on `ExtractedSymbol` with `children: Vec<ExtractedSymbol>`, making `ParseResult.symbols` a tree of top-level symbols with nested children. Both parsers already walk the AST recursively passing `name_context` — the change remodels them to collect children into the parent node instead of appending to a shared flat vec. The pipeline does DFS insertion, threading `parent_symbol_id` downward. A `flatten_symbols` helper preserves flat-list access for the resolver and tests.

